{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41667","headline":"赠温州韩使君 · 陈陶","name":"赠温州韩使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"康乐风流五百年，永嘉铃阁又登贤。\n严城鼓动鱼惊海，华屋尊开月下天。\n内使笔锋光案牍，鄢陵诗句满山川。\n今来谁似韩家贵，越绝髦幢鴈影连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}